@startuml
[*] --> NORMAL
NORMAL --> CHECK_REQUESTED : evento / solicitud
CHECK_REQUESTED --> SAFE : Estoy bien
CHECK_REQUESTED --> HELP_REQUIRED : Necesito ayuda
CHECK_REQUESTED --> UNABLE_TO_EXIT : No puedo salir
CHECK_REQUESTED --> NO_RESPONSE : sin respuesta
NO_RESPONSE --> TRUSTED_QUORUM_PENDING : política N-de-M
TRUSTED_QUORUM_PENDING --> TRUSTED_QUORUM_MET : quórum cumplido
TRUSTED_QUORUM_MET --> WELFARE_CHECK_ACTIVE
TRUSTED_QUORUM_MET --> INSTITUTIONAL_REFERENCE_ADDED : si existe reporte oficial
WELFARE_CHECK_ACTIVE --> LOCATED_SAFE
WELFARE_CHECK_ACTIVE --> LOCATED_HELP_REQUIRED
SAFE --> CLOSED
LOCATED_SAFE --> CLOSED
LOCATED_HELP_REQUIRED --> CLOSED
note bottom of NO_RESPONSE
NO_RESPONSE no equivale a MISSING,
KIDNAPPED ni DEAD.
end note
@enduml
